  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Lenny** (1 other source): Lenny runs straight into Turn It Out, which runs straight into ED Hambone without a break [1]\n- **If You Want Me To Stay** (1 other source): A Sly & The Family Stone cover, reached by segue from Jesus Children Of America [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Intro #1 (Words)/Vapor**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Intro #3/Aladdin**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Headphones**: rare: 5 archived performances [5]\n- **The Dump**: rare: 8 archived performances [5]\n- **ED Hambone**: back after 49 archived shows (722 days); rare: 3 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2005-02-17.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 15 songs; 127 min; rated 4.33/5 by 3 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer says the night was very hot, with a great room and a good crowd [4]\n- A new intro was played in addition to the usual Intro 2 [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2005-02-17.flac16**: taped by Rob Clarke; transferred by Rob Clarke; source: Neumann KM184 -> Oade w-mod UA-5 (48 kHz) -> Optical -> JB3 [1]",
